sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant FileService
    participant BlockService
    participant MetaDB
    participant S3
    participant CDN
    
    Note over Client,CDN: Chunked File Upload
    
    Client->>API: POST /files/upload-init<br/>{filename, size, hash}
    API->>FileService: Initialize upload
    FileService->>MetaDB: Create pending file record
    FileService->>FileService: Calculate chunks (4MB each)
    FileService-->>Client: {uploadId, chunks: [{url, index}]}
    
    par Upload chunks in parallel
        Client->>S3: PUT /chunk/0 (pre-signed URL)
        S3-->>Client: 200 OK
    and
        Client->>S3: PUT /chunk/1
        S3-->>Client: 200 OK
    and
        Client->>S3: PUT /chunk/N
        S3-->>Client: 200 OK
    end
    
    Client->>API: POST /files/{uploadId}/complete
    API->>BlockService: Verify & assemble chunks
    BlockService->>S3: Verify all chunks present
    BlockService->>BlockService: Calculate final hash
    BlockService->>S3: Assemble file
    BlockService->>MetaDB: Store block references
    BlockService-->>API: File assembled
    API->>MetaDB: Update file status = ready
    API-->>Client: {fileId, size, hash}
    
    Note over Client,CDN: File Download
    
    Client->>API: GET /files/{fileId}/download
    API->>FileService: Get file metadata
    FileService->>MetaDB: Query file
    MetaDB-->>FileService: File record
    FileService->>FileService: Generate signed CDN URL
    FileService-->>Client: 302 Redirect to CDN
    Client->>CDN: GET file content
    CDN->>S3: Fetch from origin (cache miss)
    CDN-->>Client: Stream file content
